.TH KINTSUGI-SKILLS 1 "2026-10-22" "kintsugi 0.8.0" "Kintsugi Manual"
.SH NAME
kintsugi-skills \- workspace skills
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kintsugi skills
list
.br
.B kintsugi skills
show <name>
.SH DESCRIPTION
List and view workspace skills. Skills are markdown files that teach the agent
how to perform specific tasks.
.SH COMMANDS
.IP \fBlist\fR
Show skills with name, description, path
.IP \fBshow\fR
Print a skill's full body
.SH EXAMPLES
List skills:
.PP
  $ kintsugi skills list
.PP
View a skill:
.PP
  $ kintsugi skills show git-commit
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kintsugi (1),
.BR kintsugi-memory (1)
